{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/pulls/2188","id":4962212407,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAivEQM8AAAABJ8VaNw","html_url":"https://github.com/osfans/trime/pull/2188","diff_url":"https://github.com/osfans/trime/pull/2188.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/osfans/trime/pull/2188.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/issues/2188","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/pulls/2188/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/pulls/2188/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/issues/2188/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/statuses/e009dc0b567f9639cf518bc3b35cd172ac627be7","number":2188,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(ime): create deferred input views when the theme is ready","user":{"login":"X2M7","id":239118790,"node_id":"U_kgDODkCpxg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/239118790?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7","html_url":"https://github.com/X2M7","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"When the framework requests the IME before theme initialization, `onCreateInputView()`\nreturns null. The framework can retain that empty input frame after the theme\nbecomes available, leaving a blank keyboard until the IME is switched away and back.\n\nComplete that deferred request after the first theme scope is ready. Create only\nmissing input/candidate trees and replay an active virtual view's start with the\nlatest `EditorInfo`. Finishing clears the pending start; destruction clears both\nflags. Completion does not call `showWindow`. This is one service-file fix directly based on `develop` at `12ffd16f`.\n\nValidation at `2d2fbce7`:\n\n- Single-file ktlint, diff checking and independent lifecycle/source review passed;\n  all 301 exact-source application JVM tests passed.\n- The fork push built exact `2d2fbce7` on four OSes. The upstream PR run built its\n  recorded synthetic merge ref on four OSes while binding that head. All eight\n  jobs passed. The original fork Ubuntu artifact's four ABI-specific APKs passed\n  signature, ELF, BuildConfig and 20-pin checks. Native evidence establishes\n  CMake/Ninja tasks, not object-by-object recompilation.\n- The fix is included in combined T9 head `9f86bc8f`; eight reviewed startup\n  fragments match byte-for-byte. The standalone startup APK is not device-tested.\n  API21 naturally deferred, then constructed its keyboard in the same process\n  without another IME toggle or SHOW. After actual maintenance success, real\n  T9 touches selected and committed `你好`; its first Observer stopped normally.\n  API35 supports delayed creation, the latest numeric editor and literal `2`\n  after an explicit SHOW; continuously visible automatic recovery was not established.\n\nThe [original failure and diagnostic control](https://github.com/X2M7/trime/blob/06dd2ac672aeb96d94a88a40cd6b56abaf140080/doc/contribution-split/checks/deferred-input-view-negative-20261022/provenance.json),\n[cloud audit](https://github.com/X2M7/trime/blob/06dd2ac672aeb96d94a88a40cd6b56abaf140080/doc/contribution-split/checks/deferred-input-view-cloud-final-20261022/final-cloud-supplement-summary.json), [API21 startup scope](https://github.com/X2M7/trime/blob/06dd2ac672aeb96d94a88a40cd6b56abaf140080/doc/contribution-split/checks/deferred-input-view-api21-startup-20261022/startup-lifecycle-qualification1.json) and\n[API35 scope](https://github.com/X2M7/trime/blob/06dd2ac672aeb96d94a88a40cd6b56abaf140080/doc/contribution-split/checks/deferred-input-view-api35-20261022/independent/g1-independent-limited-qualification.json) retain original files, rejected attempts and warnings.\nDevice checks used controlled test profiles, including three explicit preferences\nand an isolated Debug reinstall. Hide-before-ready and physical-keyboard behavior,\nRelease, real-user upgrades, hardware, TalkBack and performance remain unqualified.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-22T04:42:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T03:57:47Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"66ebea7c04dab06db9074790331f33687353fdd3","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"X2M7:contrib/pr-deferred-input-view","ref":"contrib/pr-deferred-input-view","repo":{"id":1252010092,"node_id":"R_kgDOSqAobA","name":"trime","full_name":"X2M7/trime","owner":{"login":"X2M7","id":239118790,"node_id":"U_kgDODkCpxg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/239118790?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7","html_url":"https://github.com/X2M7","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/received_even